      "code_hash": "9eaee021b998454c5aa27bd4bb7f1fc0",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-1-raw-trade-data\">Step 1 \u2014 Raw Trade Data</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Every trade has: <code>maker</code> (limit order), <code>taker</code> (hits it), <code>side</code> (BUY/SELL\nfrom maker's perspective), <code>price</code>, <code>size</code> (tokens), and <code>asset_id</code> (which\ntoken was traded).</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Trades</strong></td>\n<td>387,434,752</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Markets</strong></td>\n<td>419,904</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Unique makers</strong></td>\n<td>1,006,259</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Unique takers</strong></td>\n<td>2,181,445</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Period</strong></td>\n<td><code>2022-11-21 19:50:09</code> \u2192 <code>2026-02-26 06:45:40</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bkHC",
      "code_hash": "4f1f20bb2a198600fa80d7eda592306c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-2-token-mapping\">Step 2 \u2014 Token Mapping</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each market has two tradeable tokens: <strong>YES</strong> and <strong>NO</strong>.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>token_market_map</code> maps each <code>asset_id</code> to <code>(condition_id, outcome, winner)</code>.</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Token Side</th>\n<th>Trades</th>\n<th>%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>YES</td>\n<td>167,173,861</td>\n<td>44.0%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NO</td>\n<td>212,465,779</td>\n<td>56.0%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>44% of trades are on NO tokens</strong> \u2014 we must track both sides to get\ncorrect positions.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "dfa145cdc22dc781561aeab61144d137",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-3-resolution-ground-truth\">Step 3 \u2014 Resolution Ground Truth</h2>\n<div class=\"language-sql codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">SELECT</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resolved_at</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">winner_outcome</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">coalesce</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">yes_won</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">false</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yes_won</span>\n<span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">markets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span>\n<span class=\"k\">LEFT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">JOIN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">SELECT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yes_won</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">token_market_map</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">outcome</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;YES&#39;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AND</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">winner</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">true</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">ON</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span>\n<span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">resolution_value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Resolved markets</td>\n<td><strong>419,736</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>YES won</td>\n<td>160,610 (38.3%)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NO won</td>\n<td>259,126 (61.7%)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "PKri",
      "code_hash": "7d95db1fd2a9b99022f7703380e48998",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-4-from-trades-to-positions\">Step 4 \u2014 From Trades to Positions</h2>\n<h3 id=\"how-a-trade-works\">How a trade works</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Each trade has a <strong>maker</strong> (limit order) and <strong>taker</strong> (market order).\n<code>side</code> is always from the <strong>maker's</strong> perspective:</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Maker</th>\n<th>Taker</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>BUY</strong></td>\n<td>receives tokens, pays USDC</td>\n<td>gives tokens, receives USDC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>SELL</strong></td>\n<td>gives tokens, receives USDC</td>\n<td>receives tokens, pays USDC</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"tracking-token-balances\">Tracking token balances</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We track <strong>YES tokens</strong> and <strong>NO tokens</strong> separately per (trader, market):</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Trade on...</th>\n<th>side=BUY</th>\n<th>side=SELL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>YES token</strong></td>\n<td>maker: +size YES</td>\n<td>maker: -size YES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>taker: -size YES</td>\n<td>taker: +size YES</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>NO token</strong></td>\n<td>maker: +size NO</td>\n<td>maker: -size NO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>taker: -size NO</td>\n<td>taker: +size NO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"position-at-resolution\">Position at resolution</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">After summing all trades per (trader, market):</span>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>net_yes</th>\n<th>net_no</th>\n<th>Position</th>\n<th>Profit if...</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n<td>&lt;= 0</td>\n<td><strong>LONG YES</strong></td>\n<td>YES wins: $1/token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;= 0</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n<td><strong>LONG NO</strong></td>\n<td>NO wins: $1/token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n<td>&gt; 0</td>\n<td><strong>HEDGED</strong></td>\n<td>partial both sides</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;= 0</td>\n<td>&lt;= 0</td>\n<td><strong>CLOSED</strong></td>\n<td>sold before resolution</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "b487f37c275a9746a5005a8284127801",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"aggregation-sql\">Aggregation SQL</h3>\n<div class=\"language-sql codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">CREATE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">TABLE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">IF</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">NOT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">EXISTS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">_tmp_s1_positions</span>\n<span class=\"n\">ENGINE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MergeTree</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"k\">ORDER</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">BY</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">trader</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"k\">AS</span>\n<span class=\"k\">WITH</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Map each asset to its market + YES/NO side</span>\n<span class=\"n\">token_info</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"k\">SELECT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">asset_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"n\">outcome</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;YES&#39;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_yes</span>\n<span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">token_market_map</span>\n<span class=\"p\">),</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Only resolved markets (no point tracking open positions)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">resolved</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"k\">SELECT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span>\n<span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">markets</span>\n<span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resolution_value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"p\">),</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Enrich every trade with YES-normalized price</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- yes_price = price if YES token, 1-price if NO token</span>\n<span class=\"n\">enriched</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"k\">SELECT</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">side</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"k\">size</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">amount_usd</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">maker</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">taker</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">ti</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_yes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ti</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">is_yes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">price</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yes_price</span>\n<span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trades_raw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span>\n<span class=\"k\">JOIN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">token_info</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ti</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">ON</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">asset_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ti</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">asset_id</span>\n<span class=\"k\">WHERE</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">IN</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">SELECT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">FROM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">resolved</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">),</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">-- One row per participant per trade</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Maker BUY = +tokens, Maker SELL = -tokens</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Taker = opposite of maker</span>\n<span class=\"n\">participants</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n<span class=\"c1\">-- Maker side</span>\n<span class=\"k\">SELECT</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">assumeNotNull</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">maker</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">                             </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trader</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">condition_id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">amount_usd</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">yes_price</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">amount_usd</span><span class=\"w\">                           </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">yes_px_vol</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">is_yes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">side</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"s1\">&#39;BUY&#39;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">size</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"k\">size</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"k\">AS</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d_yes</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">NOT</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_yes</span><span class=